The typelist port provides a canonical, sorted, deduplicated C++23 module
typelist library (`import typelist;`), with an optional C++26 reflection
variant (`import typelist.reflect;`).

To use it, add the following to your CMakeLists.txt:

    find_package(typelist CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(my-target PRIVATE typelist::typelist)

Optional vcpkg features:
    reflection - Build and install `typelist::reflect` (`import typelist.reflect;`, C++26 + `-freflection`).
    skills     - Install AI agent skill into share/agent-skills/typelist.
